config SWEEP_USB_ONLY_DONGLE
    bool "Do not advertise the dongle as a BLE keyboard"
    depends on ZMK_BLE
    help
      The dongle still uses BLE as the split central, to connect to the
      halves. It does not advertise itself as a keyboard the computer can
      pair to. The computer connection is USB HID only.

      Turn this on from the dongle conf. ZMK main has no setting for it.
